<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Repair</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 20)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast repair &lt;item you carry&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster runs a hand along the item and chants 'Mes riforj', and it 
glows with a warm light as its wear is mended: between a sixth and a 
third of what it can take. It works on items still holding more than a 
quarter of their strength, so it can save things too worn for 
<a cmd='#'>Help Mending</a>.
</p><p>Like all the mending spells, every casting costs the item something: the 
most wear it can ever take shrinks by an eighth each time, so an item 
repaired again and again grows ever more fragile. <a cmd='#'>Help Reconstruct</a> 
mends as much for only half that cost. Indestructible items need none.
</p><p>You must be standing, and carry the item. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mending</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Reconstruct</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Craftsmanship</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Creation Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>